package standard.text

/// Text encoding for `String` ↔ bytes conversions. v1 only supports UTF-8;
/// further variants (UTF-16, Latin-1, ASCII strict, …) will be added when
/// there is a real user. Charset is intentionally a cross-cutting type —
/// network, file I/O, and parser libraries all need encoding awareness.
public enum Charset =
    Utf8
